  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the LR circuit shown in the figure. If the switch S is closed at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> then the amount of charge that passes through the battery between <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/527efd6a-63ca-4856-8941-456360a46842-image.png\" style=\"width: 290px; height: 177px;\" />",
