  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The current in the LR circuit&nbsp;at any time&nbsp;<math><mi>t</mi></math> is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;are the EMF, resistance, inductance and the current respectively.<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Charge flown through the circuit from time 0 to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<br />(charge)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></munderover><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></msubsup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn><